    "updated_at": "2018-03-29T04:05:46Z",
    "body": "So, [obtaining images](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/images.html#when-to-obtain-images) says: \r\n\r\n> A user agent that obtains images on demand must update the image data of an img element whenever it needs the image data (i.e., on demand), but only if the img element's current request's state is unavailable.\r\n\r\nI was expecting something like,  \"but only if the img element **is connected** and the current request's state is unavailable\". \r\n\r\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
